        "body": "Appian Corp is a public company headquartered in McLean, Virginia, trading under the ticker APPN and registered with the SEC under CIK 0001441683. Its website describes the company as a provider of AI automation for critical business processes, with a platform that orchestrates AI agents, systems, and people without replacing existing systems. The site says Appian has been automating processes for more than 25 years and was named a Leader in the 2025 Gartner Magic Quadrant for Business Orchestration and Automation Technologies.\n\nThe company's site highlights AI-powered process automation across areas such as accounts payable and receivable, invoice processing, procurement, audit workflows, case resolution, onboarding, and order fulfillment. It claims onboarding time can be cut by up to 50%. The platform is described as enabling no-code app building and embedding AI agents to extract data, act autonomously, and generate code from natural language prompts. Appian also points to an AI Value Study with Harvard Business Review Analytic Services.\n\nVirginia court records list 152 entries associated with Appian Corp. The company's SEC registration and public-company status are reflected in its CIK number and ticker.",
